            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two years after losing their friend Fynn, Barry, Arlene and Nellie return to the place where everything changed: the Pit of Evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The three friends decide to spend the night nearby. But what begins as a quiet trip soon takes a terrifying turn. Their camp is attacked, the group is torn apart, and Barry suffers the same fate as Fynn before him — falling into the Pit of Evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separated from his friends and trapped in an unknown place, Barry must uncover the secrets of the Pit and discover what lies within its depths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746020/extras/bed4f5a6868ba27354becde4f45512a1.avif?t=1788970838\" width=520 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barry:</strong> A skilled swordfighter who trains hard and tries to do the right thing while keeping his friends together. The pressure can sometimes bring out his rougher side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arlene:</strong> She loves teasing her friends, but also tends to worry about almost everything. She treasures a golden pendant given to her by Barry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fynn:</strong> A rebellious boy who loves adventure and discovering new things. Ignoring the rules of Eternia often gets him into trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nellie:</strong> A creative girl who loves drawing, but her temper can sometimes get the better of her. She cares deeply for her pet piglet, Snoots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elijah:</strong> A quiet loner who takes protecting others seriously. When his anger builds up, however, he can lose his temper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Madison:</strong> Mischievous and outgoing, Madison loves getting a reaction out of others. Beneath that lively attitude, however, she often feels lonely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery-driven story with unexpected twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of characters with deep personal connections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced party-based ATB combat (Active Time Battle)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On-map encounters powered by the Chrono Engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons with puzzle elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dramatic cutscenes, including flashbacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive world map and journal system</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two years after losing their friend Fynn, Barry, Arlene and Nellie return to the place where everything changed: the Pit of Evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The three friends decide to spend the night nearby. But what begins as a quiet trip soon takes a terrifying turn. Their camp is attacked, the group is torn apart, and Barry suffers the same fate as Fynn before him — falling into the Pit of Evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separated from his friends and trapped in an unknown place, Barry must uncover the secrets of the Pit and discover what lies within its depths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746020/extras/bed4f5a6868ba27354becde4f45512a1.avif?t=1788970838\" width=520 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barry:</strong> A skilled swordfighter who trains hard and tries to do the right thing while keeping his friends together. The pressure can sometimes bring out his rougher side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arlene:</strong> She loves teasing her friends, but also tends to worry about almost everything. She treasures a golden pendant given to her by Barry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fynn:</strong> A rebellious boy who loves adventure and discovering new things. Ignoring the rules of Eternia often gets him into trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nellie:</strong> A creative girl who loves drawing, but her temper can sometimes get the better of her. She cares deeply for her pet piglet, Snoots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elijah:</strong> A quiet loner who takes protecting others seriously. When his anger builds up, however, he can lose his temper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Madison:</strong> Mischievous and outgoing, Madison loves getting a reaction out of others. Beneath that lively attitude, however, she often feels lonely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery-driven story with unexpected twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of characters with deep personal connections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced party-based ATB combat (Active Time Battle)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On-map encounters powered by the Chrono Engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons with puzzle elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dramatic cutscenes, including flashbacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive world map and journal system</p></li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Two years after losing their friend Fynn, Barry, Arlene and Nellie return to the mysterious Pit of Evil. When their camp is attacked, the group is torn apart and Barry falls into the Pit, where he must uncover its secrets in a story-driven JRPG with fast-paced ATB combat.",
